        <a class="docs-guide-card" href="/docs/codex"><span class="docs-guide-icon"><Heroicon Name="cpu-chip" Size="20" /></span><span><strong>Codex CLI</strong><small>Pengaturan konteks OAuth langganan dan Endpoint gateway.</small></span><Heroicon Name="chevron-right" Size="17" /></a>
